{"id":"600566","name":"椒盐馒头丁","author":"斌joanliu","authorId":"11138610","desc":"","cover":"images/600566/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"馒头","amount":"2个"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"1个"}],"sub":[{"name":"水","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"冷冻的馒头蒸热冷却，切成丁。","img":"images/600566/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"鸡蛋打散，加一点点水，加一点盐，搅匀。","img":"images/600566/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"馒头丁放入鸡蛋液中，拌匀。","img":"images/600566/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"热锅放油，再加热。","img":"images/600566/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"放入馒头丁，翻炒一分钟。","img":"images/600566/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"关火，撒入椒盐粉和孜然粉。","img":"images/600566/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"出锅。","img":"images/600566/step_7.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}